{
  "name": "cli-classifier",
  "description": "cli-classifier is the single public skill identity for classifier models served on this machine. It routes a request to its cli-deem transport through mode-registry.json and hub-router.json and holds no packet-local logic. The advisor sees one hub. The transport asks the local Deem server for one typed value and never mutates this workspace.",
